#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qedma support team is here to help! If you encounter any issues or have questions about using the QESEM quantum function, please don't hesitate to reach out. Our knowledgeable and friendly support staff are ready to assist you with any technical concerns or inquiries you may have.\n"
msgstr "Pasukan sokongan Qedma sedia membantu! Jika anda menghadapi sebarang isu atau mempunyai soalan tentang penggunaan fungsi kuantum QESEM, jangan teragak-agak untuk menghubungi kami. Kakitangan sokongan kami yang berpengetahuan dan mesra bersedia membantu anda dengan sebarang kebimbangan teknikal atau pertanyaan yang anda miliki.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can email us at support@qedma.com for assistance. Please include as much detail as possible about the issue you're experiencing to help us provide a swift and accurate response. You can also contact your dedicated Qedma POC representative via email or phone.\n"
